#NEXUS

[ knoll2019z_fig4: Titanosaur cladogram, read by eye; fully resolved and pectinate. The arrows labelled LAB and XII mark character changes at two nodes and are not clade names; they are not encoded. The braincase reconstructions are not encoded. 6 tips, fully resolved. Sample 7 case (census 2, seed 20261241). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=6;
    TAXLABELS
        Sarmientosaurus
        Dzharakuduk_Titanosauria
        'Métisson Titanosauria'
        Lohuecotitan
        Lo_Hueco_Lithostrotia
        Jainosaurus
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE knoll2019z_fig4 = [&R] (Sarmientosaurus,(Dzharakuduk_Titanosauria,('Métisson Titanosauria',(Lohuecotitan,(Lo_Hueco_Lithostrotia,Jainosaurus)))));
END;
